{
  "_doc": {
    "about": "Schedule-send suggestions on the snooze engine (see snooze-fixtures.json for keys, partitions and the America/New_York zone). Run by shared/src/send-suggest.spec.ts and Android :core.",
    "rows": "sendRows(partitions, now): learned rows (rankDeep, at most 4) then the defaults D0@0800, D0@1300, Wd1@0800 in that order, skipping a default that does not resolve or lands within 30 minutes of a row already taken, until there are 4; sorted by time. text is the snooze label without its time (English weekday names).",
    "shift": "shiftMinutes(unit, maxMinutes): unit in [0,1) to whole minutes, never 0: index = floor(unit * 2*maxMinutes) clamped to 0..2*maxMinutes-1; index 0..maxMinutes-1 -> -maxMinutes..-1, maxMinutes..2*maxMinutes-1 -> +1..+maxMinutes.",
    "random": "seededRandom(seed) is mulberry32 over unsigned 32-bit state: state += 0x6D2B79F5; t = imul(state ^ (state >>> 15), state | 1); t ^= t + imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61); out = ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 2^32. `first` are its first five outputs.",
    "vary": "varySendTimes(times, now, seededRandom(seed), maxMinutes): one draw per time in order; sendAt = chosenAt + shift minutes, but if that is not more than 60 s after now the shift's absolute value is used.",
    "setting": "varySetting(settings): enabled unless settings.varySendTimes is exactly false; maxMinutes = settings.varySendMaxMinutes rounded half up (Math.round) and clamped to 1..30 when it is a finite number, else 10. A null settings object reads as all defaults.",
    "outboxShown": "outboxShownAt(docs, nowMs): null when every doc is sent (or none); else the earliest per unsent doc of: nowMs if failed, blocked or retrying, or if sendAt - nowMs > 10000 (scheduled past undo send); otherwise max(nowMs, sendAt + 20000)."
  },
